msgstr "嵌入提供商的向量大小不斷變動。在 OpenKnowledge 重新啟動前，語意搜尋將保持關閉。"

msgid "The endpoint answered, but not with an OpenAI-compatible embeddings response. Check the base URL."
msgstr "端點有回應，但傳回的不是相容 OpenAI 的嵌入回應。請檢查基底 URL。"

msgid "The endpoint didn't respond in time."
msgstr "端點沒有及時回應。"

msgid "The file is in your {trashNoun}; the file-watcher will reconcile."
msgstr "檔案已在你的{trashNoun}中；檔案監看程式會進行同步。"

msgid "The file on disk, and the id agents use."
msgstr "磁碟上的檔案，以及代理使用的 id。"

msgid "The file was restored to an older version. Current is the version OpenKnowledge protected. Incoming is the restored version. Choose which version to keep, then apply your changes."
msgstr "檔案已還原為較舊的版本。目前版本是 OpenKnowledge 保護的版本。傳入版本是還原的版本。請選擇要保留的版本，然後套用變更。"

msgid "The file was restored to an older version. Open it to choose which version to keep."
msgstr "檔案已還原為較舊的版本。開啟它以選擇要保留的版本。"

msgid "The folder on disk and the id agents use to invoke this skill."
msgstr "磁碟上的資料夾，以及代理呼叫這個技能時使用的 id。"

msgid "The folders and templates are already here, so there's nothing to add."
msgstr "資料夾和範本都已經在這裡了，沒有東西要加。"

msgid "The formula <0>c = √(a² + b²)</0> renders inline."
msgstr "公式 <0>c = √(a² + b²)</0> 會以行內形式顯示。"

msgid "The index files stay in place. Open Knowledge removes only the Git rule it added."
msgstr "索引檔案保留在原處。 Open Knowledge 僅刪除它所新增的 Git 規則。"

msgid "The interface is still in the language you were reading. Check your connection, then reload to try again."
msgstr "介面仍是你先前閱讀的語言。請檢查網路連線，然後重新載入再試一次。"

msgid "The language OpenKnowledge speaks; System follows your operating system. Your own notes stay in the language you wrote them in."
msgstr "OpenKnowledge 使用的語言；「跟隨系統」會跟隨你的作業系統。你自己的筆記會保持你書寫時的語言。"

msgid "The menu label agents pick this template by (required)."
msgstr "代理挑選這個範本時看到的選單標籤（必填）。"

msgid "The model id your endpoint serves. Its vector size is detected automatically — clear the field to go back to {DEFAULT_EMBEDDINGS_MODEL}."
msgstr "你的端點提供的模型 id。它的向量維度會自動偵測——把欄位清空就會恢復成 {DEFAULT_EMBEDDINGS_MODEL}。"

msgid "the open agent"
msgstr "已開啟的代理"

msgid "The OpenKnowledge project is missing at this checkout path."
msgstr "此簽出路徑缺少 OpenKnowledge 專案。"

msgid "The OpenKnowledge project path on this branch cannot be read. The worktree was created but not opened."
msgstr "無法讀取此分支中的 OpenKnowledge 專案路徑。工作樹已建立，但未開啟。"

msgid "The OpenKnowledge project path on this branch leaves the worktree. The worktree was created but not opened."
msgstr "此分支中的 OpenKnowledge 專案路徑位於工作樹之外。工作樹已建立，但未開啟。"

msgid "The OpenKnowledge server took too long to answer, and the change may still have gone through. Ask the agent to check before trying again."
msgstr "OpenKnowledge 伺服器回應逾時，變更可能已經生效。請讓代理先確認，然後再重試。"

msgid "The OpenKnowledge server took too long to answer. Ask the agent to try again."
msgstr "OpenKnowledge 伺服器回應逾時。請讓代理重試。"

msgid "The original text was deleted."
msgstr "原始文字已被刪除。"

msgid "The path can't leave the skill (no . or ..)"
msgstr "路徑不能離開技能（不允許 . 或 ..）"

msgid "The plugin also ships {0} — named here, never installed by OK."
msgstr "該外掛還附帶 {0} — 僅在此列出，OK 絕不會安裝。"

msgid "The preview blocks resources that don't meet its security rules (for example plain http:// URLs, or code that uses eval). The content above may render incompletely."
msgstr "預覽會擋掉不符合它安全性規則的資源（例如純 http:// 的 URL，或用了 eval 的程式碼）。上面的內容可能顯示不完整。"

msgid "The project's server is on a different branch than this window — content can't load."
msgstr "該專案的伺服器所在分支與此視窗不一致，內容無法載入。"

msgid "The prompt was pasted but not submitted automatically. Review it, then press Enter to send it."
msgstr "提示詞已貼上，但未自動提交。請檢查內容，然後按 Enter 傳送。"

msgid "The properties block at the top of this doc has a formatting error. Switch to source mode to fix it."
msgstr "這份文件最上面的屬性區塊有格式錯誤。請切換到原始碼模式修正。"

msgid "The properties changed, but could not be compared — the YAML did not parse. Both versions are shown as written."
msgstr "屬性有變更，但無法比較——YAML 解析失敗。兩個版本均按原樣顯示。"

msgid "The provenance, trust, and lifecycle families: sources, generated, verified, status, and stale_after. Every field is optional, and absence is never an error."
msgstr "來源、信任與生命週期系列：sources、generated、verified、status 和 stale_after。每個欄位都是可選的，缺席絕不是一個錯誤。"

msgid "The provider is rate-limiting this key. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "供應商正在對這把金鑰限流。請稍候再試。"

msgid "The provider rejected the request (HTTP {0}). Check the API key and the model id."
msgstr "供應商拒絕了這個要求（HTTP {0}）。請檢查 API 金鑰和模型 id。"

msgid "The provider rejected the request. Check the API key and the model id."
msgstr "供應商拒絕了這個要求。請檢查 API 金鑰和模型 id。"

msgid "The provider's vector size kept changing. Restart OpenKnowledge before searching by meaning again."
msgstr "提供商的向量大小不斷變動。請重新啟動 OpenKnowledge，再依含義搜尋。"

msgid "The public URL your tunnel serves (for example your Tailscale https://…ts.net address). The server admits requests for this host and advertises it in the URLs it issues."
msgstr "您的通道所提供的公開 URL（例如您的 Tailscale https://…ts.net 位址）。伺服器接受針對此主機的請求，並在其發出的 URL 中公布該位址。"

msgid "The repository is private and your GitHub account doesn't have access to it."
msgstr "這個儲存庫是私人的，你的 GitHub 帳戶沒有存取權。"

msgid "The repository was moved, renamed, or deleted."
msgstr "這個儲存庫被移動、重新命名或刪除了。"

msgid "The repository's original clone directory"
msgstr "儲存庫的原始複製目錄"

msgid "The request to enable Open Knowledge tools timed out. This thread runs without them."
msgstr "啟用 Open Knowledge 工具的請求已逾時。此執行緒將在沒有這些工具的情況下運作。"

msgid "The schema file does not exist or failed to load — adding a field creates it."
msgstr "結構描述檔案不存在或載入失敗——新增欄位就會建立它。"

msgid "The server couldn't read this project's sync status, so sync options are hidden. They appear here as soon as the sync status loads; closing and reopening Settings also retries."
msgstr "伺服器無法讀取此專案的同步狀態，因此已隱藏同步選項。同步狀態一載入完成，選項就會顯示在這裡；關閉並重新開啟設定也會重試。"

msgid "the server responded but server.lock has no port yet"
msgstr "伺服器有回應，但 server.lock 裡還沒有連接埠"

msgid "The server stopped."
msgstr "伺服器已停止。"

msgid "The server stopped. Restart it to reconnect."
msgstr "伺服器已停止。重新啟動伺服器以重新連線。"

msgid "The server will accept requests for {0} with no built-in authentication. Anyone who can reach your tunnel will have full control of this knowledge base, including sync, GitHub credentials, and local operations. Make sure the tunnel's edge restricts who can connect."
msgstr "伺服器將在沒有內建驗證的情況下接受對 {0} 的請求。任何能夠存取您通道的人都將取得對此知識庫的完全控制權，包括同步、GitHub 憑證和本機操作。請確保通道邊緣限制誰可以連線。"

msgid "The shapes of title, description, resource, and tags when you use them. None are required; declaring one only pins its type, so tags written as a comma-separated string is flagged."
msgstr "使用 title、description、resource 和 tags 時的形狀。不需要；聲明一個僅固定其類型，因此標記為以逗號分隔的字串形式編寫的 tags 。"

msgid "The shell for this session was never started."
msgstr "此工作階段的 shell 從未啟動。"

msgid "The skill's own folder — the source other locations copy or link from"
msgstr "技能自己的資料夾——其他位置從這裡複製或連結"

msgid "The skill's own folder ({path}) — the source other locations copy or link from"
msgstr "技能自己的資料夾（{path}）——其他位置從這裡複製或連結"

msgid "The skills list did not match its schema."
msgstr "技能清單與其結構定義不符。"

msgid "The source folder itself does not move."
msgstr "來源資料夾本身不會移動。"

msgid "The stored token is missing the permissions this host needs to push."
msgstr "儲存的權杖缺少這個主機推送所需的權限。"

msgid "The sync mode teammates start with the first time they open this project. It's saved in the project's OpenKnowledge settings, so it only reaches them when Config sharing below is set to Shared."
msgstr "隊友第一次開啟此專案時採用的同步模式。它保存在專案的 OpenKnowledge 設定中，因此只有當下方的設定分享設為已分享時才會傳給他們。"

msgid "The template's filename (without `.md`)."
msgstr "範本的檔案名稱（不含 `.md`）。"

msgid "The terminal and desktop rows for {label} share one setup, so changes here apply to both."
msgstr "{label} 的終端行與桌面行共用同一套設定，因此這裡的變更會同時套用到兩者。"

msgid "The terminal and desktop rows for {label} share one setup, so removing it disconnects both."
msgstr "{label} 的終端行與桌面行共用同一套設定，因此移除它會同時中斷兩者。"

msgid "The terminal background service isn't running."
msgstr "終端機背景服務未在執行。"

msgid "The terminal background service stopped before the shell could start."
msgstr "終端機背景服務在 shell 啟動前就已停止。"

msgid "The terminal can't run this command in the configured shell."
msgstr "終端機無法在設定的 shell 中執行此命令。"

msgid "The terminal couldn't start."
msgstr "終端機無法啟動。"

msgid "The terminal is turned off for this project. Turn it back on to run commands here."
msgstr "這個專案關閉了終端機。重新開啟後才能在這裡執行指令。"

msgid "The terminal session ended (exit code {0})."
msgstr "終端機工作階段已結束（結束代碼 {0}）。"

msgid "The terminal session ended (signal {0})."
msgstr "終端機工作階段已結束（訊號 {0}）。"

msgid "The terminal session ended."
msgstr "終端機工作階段已結束。"

msgid "The terminal stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "終端機非預期地停止了。"

msgid "The terminal.shell executable in .ok/local/config.yml was not found. Using an available Windows shell instead."
msgstr "找不到 .ok/local/config.yml 中指定的 terminal.shell 執行檔，將改用可用的 Windows shell。"

msgid "The token needs the repo and read:user scopes."
msgstr "這個權杖需要 repo 和 read:user 權限範圍。"

msgid "The username git sends with the token. Some hosts expect a fixed value: type <0>x-bitbucket-api-token-auth</0> for a Bitbucket API token, <1>x-token-auth</1> for a Bitbucket repository or workspace access token, or <2>oauth2</2> for GitLab. For Gitea, use your Gitea username. Azure DevOps accepts any value."
msgstr "git 隨權杖一起傳送的使用者名稱。有些主機要求填寫固定值：Bitbucket API 權杖填 <0>x-bitbucket-api-token-auth</0>，Bitbucket 儲存庫或工作區存取權杖填 <1>x-token-auth</1>，GitLab 填 <2>oauth2</2>。Gitea 請填你的 Gitea 使用者名稱。Azure DevOps 可填任意值。"

msgid "The workspace opened without it so the app could start."
msgstr "工作區在不載入它的情況下開啟，讓應用程式能夠啟動。"

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主題"

msgid "Theme colors"
msgstr "主題色彩"

msgid "Theme copied as base16 YAML"
msgstr "主題已複製為 base16 YAML"

msgid "Theme imported."
msgstr "主題已匯入。"

msgid "Theme name"
msgstr "主題名稱"

msgid "Theme name has unsupported characters"
msgstr "主題名稱包含不支援的字元"

msgid "Theme name is too long"
msgstr "主題名稱太長"

msgid "Theme preview"
msgstr "主題預覽"

msgid "themed preview"
msgstr "帶主題的預覽"

msgid "Themes"
msgstr "主題"

msgid "There's no project folder for this window, so a terminal can't start here."
msgstr "這個視窗沒有對應的專案資料夾，所以無法在這裡啟動終端機。"

msgid "These currently read from another folder. After linking, they read from {keep} instead."
msgstr "這些技能目前從另一個資料夾讀取。連結後，它們將改為從 {keep} 讀取。"

msgid "These links remain visible in Links and are not part of the repair queue."
msgstr "這些連結仍會顯示在「連結」中，但不屬於修復佇列。"

msgid "These rules come from your project's <0>{configFile}</0> file, which fully governs linting for this project. Turn rules on or off and edit their options here; changes write back to the file."
msgstr "這些規則來自你專案的 <0>{configFile}</0> 檔案，那個檔案完全決定了這個專案的檢查行為。可以在這裡開關規則並編輯它們的選項；變更會寫回那個檔案。"

#. Says what the OpenKnowledge-authored skills are for, and where installing one puts it
msgid "These teach your AI tools how to work with OpenKnowledge. Installing one adds it to every AI tool on this machine."
msgstr "它們教你的 AI 工具如何使用 OpenKnowledge。安裝其中一個，會把它加入本機的每個 AI 工具。"

msgid "They run without asking while this chat is open"
msgstr "在此對話開啟期間它們無需詢問即可執行"

msgid "Think"
msgstr "思考"

msgid "Thinking"
msgstr "思考中"

msgid "Thinking…"
msgstr "思考中…"

msgid "This {targetNoun} has been moved, renamed, or deleted in your local copy of branch <0>{branch}</0>, and that change hasn't synced yet."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}在你本機的 <0>{branch}</0> 分支副本中被移動、重新命名或刪除了，而那個變更還沒有同步。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} has been moved, renamed, or deleted in your local copy of branch <0>{branch}</0>. Please commit your changes or enable auto-sync."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}在你本機的 <0>{branch}</0> 分支副本中被移動、重新命名或刪除了。請提交你的變更，或啟用自動同步。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} has been moved, renamed, or deleted in your local copy, and that change hasn't synced yet."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}在你的本機副本中被移動、重新命名或刪除了，而那個變更還沒有同步。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} has been moved, renamed, or deleted in your local copy. Please commit your changes or enable auto-sync."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}在你的本機副本中被移動、重新命名或刪除了。請提交你的變更，或啟用自動同步。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} isn't on branch <0>{branch}</0>. It may not have been pushed yet."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}不在 <0>{branch}</0> 分支上。它可能還沒有被推送。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} moved to <0>{0}</0>. Open it there?"
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}已經移到 <0>{0}</0>。要在那裡開啟它嗎？"

msgid "This {targetNoun} only exists on branch <0>{shareBranch}</0>. You have uncommitted changes that prevent switching here — open it in a worktree to leave your changes untouched."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}只存在於 <0>{shareBranch}</0> 分支上。你有尚未提交的變更，沒辦法在這裡切換——請在 worktree 中開啟它，這樣你的變更就不會被動到。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} was added to branch <0>{shareBranch}</0> recently. Switch and update to open it."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}最近才被加到 <0>{shareBranch}</0> 分支。切換並更新之後就能開啟它。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} was removed from branch <0>{branch}</0>."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}已經從 <0>{branch}</0> 分支移除了。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} was shared from branch <0>{shareBranch}</0>. It doesn't exist on your current branch (<1>{currentLabel}</1>)."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}是從 <0>{shareBranch}</0> 分支分享的。它在你目前的分支（<1>{currentLabel}</1>）上不存在。"

msgid "This {targetNoun} was shared from branch <0>{shareBranch}</0>. You're currently on <1>{currentLabel}</1>."
msgstr "這個{targetNoun}是從 <0>{shareBranch}</0> 分支分享的。你目前在 <1>{currentLabel}</1> 上。"

msgid "This agent doesn't accept attachments — remove them or choose an in-app agent."
msgstr "此智慧代理不接受附件，請移除附件或改選應用程式內的智慧代理。"

msgid "This agent doesn't offer slash commands"
msgstr "此智慧代理不提供斜線指令"

msgid "This agent doesn't offer slash commands — your message will be sent as plain text"
msgstr "此智慧代理不提供斜線指令 — 你的訊息將以純文字傳送"

msgid "This agent gives OpenKnowledge no way to set this up for you. Its setup guide has the manual steps."
msgstr "此代理程式未提供讓 OpenKnowledge 代為設定的方式。請參閱其設定指南中的手動步驟。"

msgid "This agent has no file of this kind on this machine yet. Open the agent once, then check again."
msgstr "此代理程式在此裝置上尚無這類檔案。請先開啟該代理程式，然後重新檢查。"

msgid "This agent hasn't announced its commands yet"
msgstr "此智慧代理尚未公布其指令"

msgid "This agent runs through {0}, which is installed but won't run — its {1} looks broken. Open Knowledge can download a private copy of {2} {3} (about {4} MB from {5}) that won't touch the rest of your system."
msgstr "這個代理是透過 {0} 執行的，但它雖然已安裝卻無法執行——它的 {1} 似乎已損壞。Open Knowledge 可以下載一份 {2} {3} 的私人副本（約 {4} MB，來自 {5}），不會動到你系統的其他部分。"

msgid "This agent runs through {0}, which isn't installed. Open Knowledge can download a private copy of {1} {2} (about {3} MB from {4}) that won't touch the rest of your system."
msgstr "這個代理是透過 {0} 執行的，但它沒有安裝。Open Knowledge 可以下載一份 {1} {2} 的私人副本（約 {3} MB，來自 {4}），不會動到你系統的其他部分。"

msgid "This also installs the pack's {packSkillCount, plural, one {# skill} other {# skills}}."
msgstr "這也會安裝此入門套件的 {packSkillCount, plural, one {# 項技能} other {# 項技能}}。"

msgid "This branch does not contain this OpenKnowledge project. The worktree was created but not opened."
msgstr "此分支不包含這個 OpenKnowledge 專案。工作樹已建立，但未開啟。"

msgid "This branch is checked out in:"
msgstr "這個分支已在以下位置簽出："

msgid "This branch redirects an OpenKnowledge setup path outside the worktree. The worktree was created but not opened."
msgstr "此分支將 OpenKnowledge 設定路徑重新導向到工作樹之外。工作樹已建立，但未開啟。"

#. Toast after first-launch setup ends without connecting AI tools; agentConnectionsLabel is the Settings sidebar pane name
msgid "This can be configured in Settings > {agentConnectionsLabel}"
msgstr "這可以在「設定 > {agentConnectionsLabel}」中設定"

msgid "This checkout path cannot be read."
msgstr "無法讀取此簽出路徑。"

msgid "This command contains hidden characters that can make it look different from what runs. They are shown here as ⟨U+…⟩."
msgstr "此指令包含隱藏字元，可能使其看起來與實際執行的內容不同。這些字元在此顯示為 ⟨U+…⟩。"

msgid "This comment is on the whole property"
msgstr "這則註解是針對整個屬性的"

msgid "This component changed. Try again."
msgstr "此元件已變更。請再試一次。"

msgid "This component was removed."
msgstr "此元件已被移除。"

msgid "This composer doesn't accept attachments."
msgstr "此處無法附加檔案。"

msgid "This conversation"
msgstr "此對話"

msgid "This conversation keeps the window it started with. A new chat can use a different one."
msgstr "本次對話保持開始時的視窗。新對話可以使用其他視窗。"

msgid "This could not be set up because the MCP server entry it needs was not written."
msgstr "無法完成設定，因為它所需的 MCP 伺服器項目未寫入。"

msgid "This deletes the MCP server entries and skill files listed below. The agent will lose access to your documents until you add it again."
msgstr "這會刪除下方列出的 MCP 伺服器項目和技能檔案。在重新新增之前，智慧代理將無法存取你的文件。"

msgid "This development build can't connect agents, so it won't change the agent setup of your installed OpenKnowledge app."
msgstr "此開發版本無法連接智慧代理，因此不會變更你已安裝的 OpenKnowledge 應用程式的智慧代理設定。"

msgid "This disconnects {0} from OpenKnowledge."
msgstr "這會中斷 {0} 與 OpenKnowledge 的連接。"

msgid "This doc"
msgstr "這份文件"

msgid "This doc has unpushed changes. Recipients will see the last pushed version."
msgstr "這份文件有尚未推送的變更。收到的人看到的會是最後一次推送的版本。"

msgid "This doc hasn't synced to GitHub yet. The link will work after the next sync."
msgstr "這份文件還沒有同步到 GitHub。下次同步之後連結就會生效。"

msgid "This doc isn't on GitHub yet. The link won't work until it's pushed."
msgstr "這份文件還不在 GitHub 上。在推送之前連結不會生效。"

msgid "This document is already active in the editor. Use Open to collapse the graph."
msgstr "這份文件已經在編輯器中開啟了。請用「開啟」來摺疊關係圖。"

msgid "This document is missing required properties"
msgstr "這份文件缺少必要的屬性"

msgid "This document was deleted"
